        p['state_of_art']='PeruccaSgobba2019 Theorem 1.1, p.1617, gives the uniform number-field Kummer degree bound. The bounded finite-level affine indices prove openness; its ℓ-adic projection has dimension r+1. MoreeStevenhagen2014 Theorem 2.5 gives the stronger exact intrinsic index 2^r over Q.'
