        p['state_of_art']='Perucca–Sgobba2019 Theorem 1.1, published p.1617, proves a uniform bound for the failure of maximal Kummer degree over K(ζ_n). Its statement was opened in the World Scientific publisher preview; bounded finite-level affine indices give the desired openness. Moree–Stevenhagen2014 Theorem 2.5 gives the stronger exact rational saturated index 2^r and quadratic pairing. Perissinotto–Perucca2023 Theorems 1.1–1.2 give explicit degree procedures for products of one-dimensional tori.'
